---
/** The 24 hour line (docs/15 section 5). Inside the process scene the fill grows from the first stage to the second, and it rests full elsewhere. */
---

<div class="t24" role="group" aria-label="Attempt timeline">
  <div class="t24-bar"><span class="t24-fill"></span></div>
  <ul class="t24-pts">
    <li><b>Received</b>Documents and instructions</li>
    <li><b>Attempt 1</b>Typically within 24 hours</li>
    <li><b>Attempt 2</b>Recorded the same way</li>
    <li><b>Attempt 3</b>Up to 3 attempts included</li>
  </ul>
</div>
